  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have unlocked the latent powers from the storm dwelling inside you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Storm power class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain one additional storm power. You must meet all of the prerequisites for this storm power.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Each time you take this feat, choose a new storm power.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
